# Local planning research and generated comparison artifacts.
#
# Notes, reviews and rendered papers accumulate at the repo root faster than
# they can be curated, and none of them are inputs to the build. Ignore the
# whole class and re-admit the few documents that belong to the project.
*.md
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!/planforge-py/README.md
!/tutorials/**/*.md
!/tests/assets/**/*.md
*.pdf
*.html

# Personal dictionary for the Harper grammar LSP -- editor state, not project
# content, and it differs per contributor.
/.harper-dictionary.txt

/.codex
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/codex-*.md
# The project website, served by GitHub Pages from `docs/` on `main`. Ignore the
# directory's contents and re-admit exactly the hand-written site files: the
# pages, the stylesheet, the logo assets, and the marker that tells Pages to
# serve them as-is. Written as `/docs/*` plus negations rather than `/docs/`
# because git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is itself
# excluded. Anything else that lands in `docs/` -- rendered papers, notes,
# generated output -- stays ignored.
/docs/*
!/docs/*.html
!/docs/*.css
!/docs/*.svg
!/docs/.nojekyll
/dominik/
/ipc2023
/ipc2026
/numeric-fd
/*.sas
/sailing.txt
/scorpion/
/sstcp-code.zip
/test_outputs/

# Python bindings crate: track its Python sources despite the blanket *.py ignore above
!planforge-py/**/*.py
!tutorials/**/*.py
